taken_added	one
rule	one
add_to_less	one
take_from_greater	one
# A1 links the rule about persons ("him who has the greater/less") to the excess of magnitudes ("the greater", "the less", "the mean").
# The text openly uses the magnitudes as an illustration of the parties' holdings, so I read this as one intended analogy, not a slide between two senses.
# Within each claim, "greater" and "less" keep the same sense in every statement that uses it, so A1 is not a bridge.
